abstract: >-
  An interactive, single-GPU, mechanism-level reproduction of the collapse
  ablation in Table 4 of You Don't Need Strong Assumptions: Visual
  Representation Learning via Temporal Differences. The artifact includes
  frozen results, experimental lineage, compute accounting, and limitations.
keywords:
